# bridge's own markers. Anyone who can read it can act as that account.
apps/fb-bridge/.fb_bridge_auth/
# The dev stack's Postgres data directory, and any copy of it set aside after
# a crash. Root-scoped and wildcarded on purpose: the narrow `.dev-stack-data/`
# rule matched only the live one, so a directory moved aside as
# `.dev-stack-data.rusak-<time>/` became 1297 untracked files that `git add -A`
# would have committed — a 31 MB database, WAL and all.
/.dev-stack-data*/

# The dev stack's Postgres cluster (tools/local-postgres.ts).
/.dev-stack-pg/
